do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"2074b3aa1744fc80","name":"Expert Grappler","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Brawler","prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are skilled at keeping your opponents off balance in melee combat. At the beginning of your turn, you can choose to designate an opponent no more than one size category larger or smaller than you. That opponent doesn't get to add their Strength bonus on attack rolls when targeting you. (If the opponent has a Strength penalty, they still suffer from that penalty.) The opponent's Strength modifier applies to damage, as usual. You can select a new opponent on your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide","description":"You are skilled at keeping your opponents off balance in melee combat. At the beginning of your turn, you can choose to designate an opponent no more than one size category larger or smaller than you. That opponent doesn't get to add their Strength bonus on attack rolls when targeting you. (If the opponent has a Strength penalty, they still suffer from that penalty.) The opponent's Strength modifier applies to damage, as usual. You can select a new opponent on your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Brawler","treeId":"67fdd8dce9abd6c1","tags":["melee","soldier","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"45edf98f-a153-47dc-ab62-44370f495321","name":"Expert Grappler","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.grapple.bonus","mode":2,"value":"2"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Expert Grappler","effectType":"grapple_bonus"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.expert_grappler"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.916a526d8c166005"}}},{"_id":"5221b8ad33ac21c1","name":"Harm's Way","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Protection","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","description":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesSt