: When you use the Talent, the ally you aid gains one temporary Force Point at the end of their next turn. If the Force Point is not spent before the end of the encounter, it is lost. As a Swift Action, you can reroll a Knowledge check and keep the better of the two results. This can be used with any Knowledge skill you are Trained in.","description":"You can Aid Another on the Knowledge checks of an ally within 6 squares of you as a Reaction for Knowledge skills you are Trained in. You can make a Use the Force check in place of a Knowledge check for any Knowledge skill you are not Trained in. You are considered Trained in that Knowledge skill for the purposes of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a Knowledge check reroll, you can reroll your Use the Force check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations). Prerequisite: When you use the Talent, the ally you aid gains one temporary Force Point at the end of their next turn. If the Force Point is not spent before the end of the encounter, it is lost. As a Swift Action, you can reroll a Knowledge check and keep the better of the two results. This can be used with any Knowledge skill you are Trained in.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Archivist","treeId":"152047d6ab7896ad","tags":["action-economy","force","jedi","light-side","mobility","positioning","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.skilled_advisor"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.35cbdbe9c91ba1d0"}}},{"_id":"18cfd0669adc3b31","name":"Unarmed","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4-1","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"plac