oficient with pistols and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"04733e85-193e-4f4b-8792-c359083557d1","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.e5d361d01d1b44e4"}}},{"_id":"2213e99a9e40c391","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with rifles and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["non-force","ranged","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"3b695d0d-747b-4081-8b6c-8b5f8584ff43","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.765ff8a34e58acac"}}},{"_id":"f6087b9ea1a17229","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You are proficient with simple weapons and do not take the -5 penalty when using them.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["noble","non-force","scoundrel","scout","soldier"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout","Scoundrel","Noble"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{}},"effects":[{"_id":"220daaa7-e1b5-440d-98cd-10f5e586ef8b","name":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.2d680cc46a7972da"}}},{"_id":"68853a59533fe84f","name":"Battle Analysis","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Commando","prerequisites":"Trained in Initiative","benefit":"When you make a ranged attack with a Pistol or Rifle, all allies within 6 squares of you when you made the attack gain a +1 bonus to Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Allies within range don't need to be within your line of sight to gain the bonus. When you use the Mechanics skill to Handle Explosives, the explosion deals +2 dice of damage. You may take this Talent multiple times; its effects stack. You can distract opponents and convince them that you are the most tempting (or most dangerous) target in the area. As a Swift Action, make a Persuasion check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all opponents within line of sight. If the check result exceeds an opponent's Will Defense, that opponent cannot attack any character within 6 squares of you until the start of your next turn as long as you do not have Cover against that opponent. (The affected opponent may still attack you, however.) If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per round, you may spend a Swift Action to shield a single adjacent ally from attacks, taking the damage and suffering the ill effects in your ally's stead. Until the start of your next turn, any attack made against the protected ally targets you instead. You may elect not to shield your protected ally against a given attack, provided the decision is made before the attack roll is made. If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per day as a Swift Action, you can move +5 steps on the Condition Track. This does not remove any Persistent Conditions that may be affecting you. This Talent does not affect the Condition Track of a Vehicle. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, you can use it one additional time per day. You can catch a Second Wind one extra time per day. If you have this Talent and the Extra Second Wind feat, you can catch your Second Wind a total of three times per day. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue Prerequisite: Whenever you have the benefit of Cover, you can spend two Swift Actions to treat it as Improved Cover until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy Prerequisite: When one or more allies uses the Aid Another Action to give you a bonus to your attack roll, you gain a circumstance bonus equal to the total bonus provided to your damage roll. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook You add an additional die of damage when attacking with any weapon that has a Burst radius.","description":"When you make a ranged attack with a Pistol or Rifle, all allies within 6 squares of you when you made the attack gain a +1 bonus to Reflex Defense until the start of your next turn. Allies within range don't need to be within your line of sight to gain the bonus. When you use the Mechanics skill to Handle Explosives, the explosion deals +2 dice of damage. You may take this Talent multiple times; its effects stack. You can distract opponents and convince them that you are the most tempting (or most dangerous) target in the area. As a Swift Action, make a Persuasion check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all opponents within line of sight. If the check result exceeds an opponent's Will Defense, that opponent cannot attack any character within 6 squares of you until the start of your next turn as long as you do not have Cover against that opponent. (The affected opponent may still attack you, however.) If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per round, you may spend a Swift Action to shield a single adjacent ally from attacks, taking the damage and suffering the ill effects in your ally's stead. Until the start of your next turn, any attack made against the protected ally targets you instead. You may elect not to shield your protected ally against a given attack, provided the decision is made before the attack roll is made. If you are the Pilot of a Vehicle, you may use this Talent to protect allied Vehicles. You may use it to protect Vehicles no more than one size category larger than your own. Once per day as a Swift Action, you can move +5 steps on the Condition Track. This does not remove any Persistent Conditions that may be affecting you. This Talent does not affect the Condition Track of a Vehicle. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, you can use it one additional time per day. You can catch a Second Wind one extra time per day. If you have this Talent and the Extra Second Wind feat, you can catch your Second Wind a total of three times per day. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue Prerequisite: Whenever you have the benefit of Cover, you can spend two Swift Actions to treat it as Improved Cover until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy Prerequisite: When one or more allies uses the Aid Another Action to give you a bonus to your attack roll, you gain a circumstance bonus equal to the total bonus provided to your damage roll. Homebrew Reference Book: Legacy of the Force Sourcebook You add an additional die of damage when attacking with any weapon that has a Burst radius.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Commando","treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tags":["action-economy","battlefield-control","burst-damage","condition-removal","controller","defender","feat-chain","force","force-control","force-defense","force-offense","mechanics","mobility","piloting","positioning","ranged","scaling","shields","skills","social","soldier","striker","support","sustained-damage","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.battle_analysis"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.7df2e8e4f18dc909"}}},{"_id":"02234b611b1fdbee","name":"Knife","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Knife","npc":{"flatAttackBonus":5,"flatDamageFormula":"1d4","useFlat":true}}}},{"_id":"0410828660eab089","name":"Blaster Carbine","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"3d8","damageType":"energy","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"dex","range":"ranged","weight":2.5,"cost":900,"equipped":true,"description":"<p>A compact rifle suitable for close-quarters com