 Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","description":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Knight's Armor","treeId":"ea01d740c91888b3","tags":["armor","defender","lightsaber","melee","scaling","soldier","striker","sustained-damage","unarmed"]},"effects":[{"_id":"28f1f3db-0c6f-4614-bdcf-000f1542a25b","name":"Armored Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Armored Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4c236343b01ea763"}}},{"_id":"632aa7410a38eded","name":"Demolitionist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Commando","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When using Mechanics to set explosives, deal +2 dice of damage; may be taken multiple times and stacks.","description":"","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"798ed0945cbdac1c","tree":"Commando","tags":["mechanics","scaling","skills","soldier","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1e1f48cc-a5a2-4a95-a9ec-599c316d3d60","name":"Demolitionist","icon":"icons/svg/explosion.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damage.explosives","mode":2,"value":"2d6"}],"di