fit":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","description":"Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), you gain Damage Reduction equal to your Class Level until the end of your next turn. Whenever you take damage on behalf of an ally through the use of a Talent (including ), your Damage Threshold is increased by 5 points. As a Swift Action, designate one adjacent ally. Until the end of your next turn, as long as that ally remains adjacent to you, you are considered to be providing that ally with Soft Cover against all attacks.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"cb5493f65f0bdb62"}],"_source":"fix5F-canonical"},"tree":"Protection","treeId":"c92c2cbc79b8a515","tags":["action-economy","damage-reduction","defender","mobility","positioning","soldier","striker","support"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.harms_way"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.fde8157b6d097e12"}}},{"_id":"e0ba61dead8662c7","name":"Improved Armored Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Armor Specialist","prerequisites":"Armored Defense","benefit":"Your Reflex Defense bonus equals either your heroic level + half your armor bonus, or your armor bonus.","description":"Your Reflex Defense bonus equals either your heroic level plus half your armor bonus or 