Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"Once per encounter, you can turn a Critical Hit against you into a normal hit. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy Prerequisite: Once per encounter, as a Reaction, you gain a +5 luck bonus to any one Defense until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Fortune","treeId":"cee9b9398682b7d0","tags":["action-economy","defender","precision","scoundrel","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.fools_luck"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.5319a796f2c4ff64"}}},{"_id":"60072eeb3a518250","name":"Long Stride","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Master Scout","prerequisites":"Skill Focus (Initiative)","benefit":"Surefooted, Trained in Climb You do not suffer penalties when using the Accelerated Climbing application of the Climb Skill. In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Swift Action in addition to the one other Action normally allowed. If you are Surprised, you can take a single Swift Action. Normal: In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Standard Action, a Move Action, or a Swift Action. If you are Surprised, you can take no Actions.","description":"Surefooted, Trained in Climb You do not suffer penalties when using the Accelerated Climbing application of the Climb Skill. In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Swift Action in addition to the one other Action normally allowed. If you are Surprised, you can take a single Swift Action. Normal: In a Surprise Round, if you are not Surprised, you can take a Standard Action, a Move Action, or a Swift Action. If you are Surprised, you can take no Actions.","class":"Scout","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","tree":"Master Scout","treeId":"dca33c0215264a02","tags":["action-economy","ambush","controller","feat-chain","mobility","scout","striker","support","sustained-damage","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"1379eb45-3cb6-42c3-aabe-c8747b8d5bf0","name":"Long Stride","icon":"icons/svg/running.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.speed","mode":2,"value":"2","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Long Stride"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.long_stride"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.618472c99f355949"}}},{"_id":"f500ce511c013185","name":"Skirmisher","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Misfortune","prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you move at least 2 squares before your attack and end your move in a different square from where you started, you gain a +1 bonus to all your Defenses until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Sneak Attack Whenever you would gain the benefit of the Talent and you successfully hit your opponent, you deal Sneak Attack damage in addition to the normal damage dealt by the attack. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"When you move at least 2 squares before your attack and end your move in a different square from where you started, you gain a +1 bonus to all your Defenses until the start of your next turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War Prerequisites: , Sneak Attack Whenever you would gain the benefit of the Talent and you successfully hit your opponent, you deal Sneak Attack damage in addition to the normal damage dealt by the attack. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Scoundrel","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","tree":"Misfortune","treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["controller","defender","mobility","positioning","precision","scoundrel","striker"]},"effects":[{"