ulating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus alone, whichever is higher. This Talent counts as both the Talent and the Improved Talent for the purposes of prerequisites. You are adept at using a Cortosis Gauntlet to parry Lightsaber attacks. You gain a +2 bonus when making an opposed Unarmed melee attack roll against a Lightsaber attack.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Knight's Armor","treeId":"ea01d740c91888b3","tags":["armor","defender","lightsaber","melee","scaling","soldier","striker","sustained-damage","unarmed"]},"effects":[{"_id":"28f1f3db-0c6f-4614-bdcf-000f1542a25b","name":"Armored Defense","icon":"icons/svg/shield.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.defenses.reflex.misc","mode":2,"value":"1","priority":20}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Armored Defense"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.armored_defense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.4c236343b01ea763"}}},{"_id":"2db271797c88f8a7","name":"Comrades in Arms","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Trooper","prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you damage a target with a melee or ranged attack, all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Prerequisite: You can spend a Move Action to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally Moves you can immediately move up to your speed, provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally. If you are adjacent to at least one ally, enemies gain no benefit from Flanking you or any adjacent allies.","description":"When you damage a target with a melee or ranged attack, all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Prerequisite: You can spend a Move Action to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally Moves you can immediately move up to your speed, provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally. If you are adjacent to at least one ally, enemies gain no benefit from Flanking you or any adjacent allies.","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Trooper","treeId":"eff10782c1e56598","tags":["action-economy","controller","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","soldier","striker","support"]},"effects":[{"_id":"447eb878-1a6a-4172-9058-d7b681f7df83","name":"Comrades in Arms","icon":"icons/svg/users.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.attacks","mode":2,"value":"1"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Comrades in Arms"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.comrades_in_arms"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.d4dcafa34cda98c2"}}},{"_id":"253ad1c65adad86b","name":"Focused Targeting","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Trooper","prerequisites":"Comrades in Arms","benefit":"If you damage an opponent, all allies within 3 squares gain +2 damage against that target.","description":"","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","id":"swse.talent.comrades_in_arms"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"eff10782c1e56598","tree":"Trooper","tags":["feat-chain","positioning","soldier","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[{"_id":"2fbf83f3-5cce-44d0-a6db-2e585446fb9d","name":"Focused Targeting","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damage.allies","mode":2,"value":"2"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Focused Targeting"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.focused_targeting"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.6c52d837af948ca0"}}},{"_id":"a8084b5a5bd71b36","name":"Greater Weapon Focus","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Weapon Master","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Devastating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Penetrating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Reduction as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Weapon Specialization (Chosen Weapon)","description":"Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Devastating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Penetrating Attack (Chosen Weapon) Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you're proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using the chosen Exotic Weapon or weapon from the chosen group, you treat your target's Damage Reduction as if it were 10 points lower when determining the results of your attack. Prerequisites: (Chosen Weapon), Weapon Specialization (Chosen Weapon)","class":"Elite Trooper","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","tree":"Weapon Master","treeId":"2f720d8