+10 (3d8+5), Blaster Rifle +10 (4d8+5) with Deadeye","Attack Options":["Vibroblade","Blaster Rifle"],"Force Powers":[],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":[],"Strength":"14","Dexterity":"16","Constitution":"13","Intelligence":"10","Wisdom":"12","Charisma":"10","Talents":["Acute Senses","Devastating Attack (Rifles)","Keen Shot","Weapon Specialization (Rifles)"],"Feats":["Armor Proficiency (Light)","Deadeye","Far Shot","Point-Blank Shot","Precise Shot","Running Attack","Shake It Off","Weapon Focus (Rifles)","Weapon Proficiency (Advanced Melee Weapons)","Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Trained Skills":["Climb","Initiative","Jump","Perception","Pilot","Stealth"],"Gear":"Vibroblade (Poisoned Blade), Blaster Rifle , Comlink (Short-Range) H- Human bonus Feat or Trained Skill Poised Blade [ ] When a creature takes damage from a successful hit with this weapon, make an attack roll (1d20+10) against the target's Fortitude Defense . If the attack succeeds, the target takes 4d6 points of damage and moves -1 step down the Condition Track . If the attack fails, the target takes only half damage and doesn't move down the Condition Track . The Poison attacks each round until it is cured with a successful DC 25 Treat Injury check.","Melee Attack":"Weapons)","Ranged Attack":"","Species Bonuses":["Attack Bonus","Human\nbonus\nFeat"]},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"nonheroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1,"statblockAuthority":true,"normalizationVersion":2,"nonheroicLegalSkeletonVersion":1,"nonheroicLegalSkeletonStatus":"heroic-profile"}}}}
