ds the target's Damage Threshold, you gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target for the remainder of the encounter. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy You gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls on attacks against targets that have been damaged by an ally since the end of your last turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy","description":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack roll that exceeds the target's Damage Threshold, you gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target for the remainder of the encounter. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy You gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls on attacks against targets that have been damaged by an ally since the end of your last turn. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Threats of the Galaxy","class":"Soldier","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","tree":"Mercenary","treeId":"4007fa87192b5884","tags":["defender","feat-chain","melee","positioning","ranged","soldier","striker","support","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dirty_fighting"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.c07b6c68e715b9ff"}}},{"_id":"15167de83d5aff57","name":"Tested in Battle","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Veteran","tree":"Veteran","prerequisites":"","description":"You know from first-hand experience that victory goes to those willing to take a chance. You can add your Wisdom bonus (minimum +1) to the damage roll when you make a successful Charge attack. Prerequisites: , Trained in Initiative You have seen more action in more places than most people know exist, and little in the galaxy gets you rattled. Any character using a Fear effect on you must roll twice, keeping the lower result on any Skill Checks and attack rolls. When you catch a Second Wind, you move +2 steps on the Condition Track in addition to regaining Hit Points.","benefit":"You know from first-hand experience that victory goes to those willing to take a chance. You can add your Wisdom bonus (minimum +1) to the damage roll when you make a successful Charge attack. Prerequisites: , Trained in Initiative You have seen more action in more places than most people know exist, and little in the galaxy gets you rattled. Any character using a Fear effect on you must roll twice, keeping the lower result on any Skill Checks and attack rolls. When you catch a Second Wind, you move +2 steps on the Condition Track in addition to regaining Hit Points.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"96c390430d7a4975","tags":["action-economy","condition-removal","controller","mobility","scout","skills","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.cccea4e91352482a"}}},{"_id":"16113a8383b863a4","name":"Weapon Specialization","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Combat","prerequisites":"Weapon Focus","benefit":"+2 melee damage.","description":"Gain +2 damage with a chosen weapon.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Lightsaber Combat","treeId":"2359c05ff13f3feb","tags":["feat-chain","jedi","lightsaber","melee","striker","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.weapon_specialization"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.41426ecd7fade0b0"}}},{"_id":"720c871e05335ef6","name":"Combat Gloves","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/sword.svg","system":{"damage":"1d4+5","damageType":"kinetic","attackBonus":0,"attackAttribute":"str","range":"melee","weight":1,"cost":0,"equipped":true,"description":"","properties":[],"ammunition":{"type":"none","current":0,"max":0},"weaponCategory":"simple","proficiency":"simple","subcategory":""},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresol