age Threshold , it dies. Otherwise, the creature continues to act normally at 0 Hit Points until a successful attack deals damage that equals or exceeds the creature's Damage Threshold . If the creature is pushed to the bottom of the Condition Track by damage, it is automatically destroyed. Body Swap: When a Force Parasite's host body is destroyed, the Force Parasite automatically enters another Animated Corpse within 10 squares (effectively transforming that creature into a Force Parasite, though any damage or conditions that the new body has already suffered transfers over to the new form). If no bodies are nearby, the Force Parasite's energy dissipates, and it is truly destroyed.</p>\n<p><strong>Attack Options:</strong> Unarmed, Blaster Pistol</p>","derived":{},"npcProfile":{"kind":"nonheroic","mode":"play","sourceAuthority":"statblock","legalProfile":"nonheroic-to-heroic","legalState":"legal-with-statblock-overrides","importMode":"play","playReady":true,"statblockAuthority":true,"sourcePack":"nonheroic","normalizationVersion":2,"authority":{"hp":"statblock","defenses":"statblock","bab":"statblock","attacks":"statblock","skills":"statblock","damageThreshold":"statblock","abilities":"statblock","features":"statblock"},"progressionReady":true,"progressionSkeleton":{"version":1,"source":"nonheroic-compendium-phase10.6","status":"mixed-class-items-created","bucket":"mixed","nonheroicFirstRule":"nonheroic-levels-must-precede-heroic-levels","nonheroicFirstValid":true,"totalLevels":15,"entries":[{"order":1,"classId":"nonheroic","name":"Nonheroic","levels":9,"source":"raw.Nonheroic Level","confidence":"exact"},{"order":2,"classId":"jedi","name":"Jedi","levels":5,"source":"raw.Class Levels","confidence":"exact"},{"order":3,"classId":"force-adept","name":"Force Adept","levels":1,"source":"raw.Class Levels","confidence":"exact"}],"warnings":[],"classItemsCreated":true,"statblockValuesPreserved":true,"classItemCreation":{"phase":"10.10","status":"created","createdClassIds":["nonheroic","jedi","force-adept"],"missingClassIds":[],"statblockValuesPreserved":true,"note":"Mixed nonheroic-to-heroic compendium actor received class item skeletons from its progression skeleton. HP, defenses, BAB, skills, attacks, feats, talents, Force powers, and raw source data were not recalculated."},"progressionLegalCandidate":true,"mixedNonheroicHeroicClassItemsCreated":true}}},"items":[{"_id":"62fded68f506b1ff","name":"Nonheroic","type":"species","img":"icons/svg/mystery-man.svg","system":{"size":"medium","speed":6,"abilities":{},"skillBonuses":{},"special":"","languages":[],"source":"","description":"","tags":[]},"effects":[],"flags":{"swse":{"placeholder":true,"unresolved":"Nonheroic"}}},{"_id":"0fc8fd195fd6865c","name":"Force Sensitivity","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You can make Use the Force checks and gain access to Force Talents.","prerequisite":"Non-Droid","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":86,"tags":["feat-chain","force"],"bonus_feat_for":[],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"You can make <a href=\"/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks and gain access to <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Talents\" title=\"Force Talents\">Force Talents</a>."}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.ddbeb23013d9e917"}}},{"_id":"d5381a39fac6a55c","name":"Force Training","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"force","benefit":"You learn a number of Force powers equal to 1 + your Wisdom modifier.","prerequisite":"Force Sensitivity, Trained in Use the Force","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":94,"tags":["feat-chain","force","jedi","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Jedi"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"forcePowerGrants":1,"description":{"value":"Learn a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Powers\" title=\"Force Powers\">Force Powers</a> equal to 1 + your <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> modifier (minimum 1)."},"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"usetheforce"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"}},"effects":[{"_id":"d1c60a9b-78e6-4601-85a4-320794fa5a91","name":"Force Training","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"feat","featName":"Force Training","effectType":"passive_effect","flagType":"Force Training"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.9b7b869a86f39190"}}},{"_id":"acf4335150693be0","name":"Improved Damage Threshold","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"Your damage threshold increases by 5.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["defender","non-force","scout","soldier","striker"],"bonus_feat_for":["Soldier","Scout"],"uses":{"current":0,"max":0,"perDay":false},"costNumeric":null,"description":{"value":"<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Damage_Threshold\" title=\"Damage Threshold\">Damage Threshold</a> increases by 5 points."}},"effects":[{"name":"Improved Damage Threshold","icon":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damageThreshold","mode":2,"value":"5","priority":20}],"transfer":true}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.feats.96666de28ba99b64"}}},{"_id":"1e0ae4bbef721007","name":"Improved Defenses","type":"feat","img":"icons/svg/upgrade.svg","system":{"featType":"general","benefit":"You gain a +1 bonus to your Reflex, Fortitude, and Will Defense.","prerequisite":"","special":"","normalText":"","sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":87,"tags":["defender","noble","non-force",