","Force Lightning","Force Slam"],"Force Secrets":[],"Force Techniques":[],"Strength":"15","Dexterity":"14","Constitution":"13","Intelligence":"16","Wisdom":"14","Charisma":"12","Talents":["Dark Presence","Force Power Adept","(","Force Grip",")","Power of the Dark Side","Swift Power"],"Feats":["Force Sensitivity","Force Training","Improved Damage Threshold","Improved Defenses","Power Attack","Powerful Charge","Rapid Strike","Skill Training (Use the Force)","Strong in the Force","Weapon Focus (Simple Weapons)","Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)","Weapon Proficiency (Simple Weapons)"],"Trained Skills":["Deception","Endurance","Initiative","Perception","Use the Force"],"Gear":"Blaster Pistol Abilities [ ] Already Dead: This creature does not fall unconscious when it reaches 0 Hit Points. If the attack that reduces the creature to 0 Hit Points also equals or exceeds the creature's Damage Threshold , it dies. Otherwise, the creature continues to act normally at 0 Hit Points until a successful attack deals damage that equals or exceeds the creature's Damage Threshold . If the creature is pushed to the bottom of the Condition Track by damage, it is automatically destroyed. Body Swap: When a Force Parasite's host body is destroyed, the Force Parasite automatically enters another Animated Corpse within 10 squares (effectively transforming that creature into a Force Parasite, though any damage or conditions that the new body has already suffered transfers over to the new form). If no bodies are nearby, the Force Parasite's energy dissipates, and it is truly destroyed.","Melee Attack":"","Ranged Attack":"","Species Bonuses":["Attack Bonus"]},"mode":"play","sourcePack":"nonheroic","sourceAuthority":"statblock","playReady":true,"normalizedForPlay":true,"playNormalizationVersion":1,"statblockAuthority":true,"normalizationVersion":2,"nonheroicLegalSkeletonVersion":1,"nonheroicLegalSkeletonStatus":"partial-legal-ready"},"npcLegalReview":{"phase10_10":{"mixedClassItemsCreated":true,"crea