ce Skill as a Move Action rather than a Full-Round Action.</p><p><strong>Related Power:</strong> Sense Force</p><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sense Force</p>","relatedPower":"Sense Force"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.forcetechniques.ad67b8f3959860f2"}}},{"_id":"820ea71998d1b20e","name":"Clear Mind","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Sentinel","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Force Haze Prerequisites: , Force Haze","description":"Force Haze Prerequisites: , Force Haze","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Sentinel","treeId":"36f18f3e974feb33","tags":["force","jedi","light-side"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.clear_mind"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.8bd201bb22c8da3a"}}},{"_id":"e6c0fe3918f222db","name":"Dark Deception","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Shadow","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Add one Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor to your Force Power Suite. Once per encounter you can use that Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor without increasing your Dark Side Score. If you spend a Force Point or Destiny Point to modify this Force Power in any way, you increase your Dark Side Score as normal.","description":"Add one Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor to your Force Power Suite. Once per encounter you can use that Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor without increasing your Dark Side Score. If you spend a Force Point or Destiny Point to modify this Force Power in any way, you increase your Dark Side Score as normal.","class":"Jedi Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","tree":"Jedi Shadow","treeId":"eab0d8bbee7e0f4f","tags":["dark-side","force","jedi","light-side","skills"]},"effects":[{"name":"Dark Deception (Class Skill)","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.skills.deception.classSkill","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Dark Deception","effectType":"class-skill"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dark_deception"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.d1561acfdeac3d78"}}},{"_id":"acbdfd473f218a8a","name":"Dark Side Sense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Sentinel","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Against creatures with a Dark Side Score of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on melee attacks equal to your Charisma bonus (minimum +1). Prerequisite: You gain a +5 Force bonus to all Defense scores against Force Powers with the [Dark Side] descriptor, and Force Powers originating from any dark Force-user (that is, any Force-use whose Dark Side Score equals their Wisdom score). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide When you interact with another sentient creature, you can use a Swift Action to reduce the impression you leave on it. When you have finished interacting with the creature, you make a Use the Force check, and if the check result exceeds the target's Will Defense, it does not remember interacting with you once you are gone. A target that is higher in level than you gains a +5 bonus to its Will Defense to resist this ability. This is a Mind-Affecting effect. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide Prerequisite: When you use a damage-dealing Force Power against a creature with a Dark Side Score of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on a successful hit equal to your Charisma bonus (minimum +1). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide If you take damage from the use of a Force Power, until the end of the encounter you gain a +2 Force bonus to all Defenses against that Force Power. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual You gain a +1 Force bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of damage on Lightsaber attacks made against a Beast with a Dark Side Score of 1+. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","description":"Against creatures with a Dark Side Score of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on melee attacks equal to your Charisma bonus (minimum +1). Prerequisite: You gain a +5 Force bonus to all Defense scores against Force Powers with the [Dark Side] descriptor, and Force Powers originating from any dark Force-user (that is, any Force-use whose Dark Side Score equals their Wisdom score). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide When you interact with another sentient creature, you can use a Swift Action to reduce the impression you leave on it. When you have finished interacting with the creature, you make a Use the Force check, and if the check result exceeds the target's Will Defense, it does not remember interacting with you once you are gone. A target that is higher in level than you gains a +5 bonus to its Will Defense to resist this ability. This is a Mind-Affecting effect. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide Prerequisite: When you use a damage-dealing Force Power against a creature with a Dark Side Score of 1 or higher, you deal extra damage on a successful hit equal to your Charisma bonus (minimum +1). Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide If you take damage from the use of a Force Power, until the end of the encounter you gain a +2 Force bonus to all Defenses against that Force Power. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual You gain a +1 Force bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of damage on Lightsaber attacks made against a Beast with a Dark Side Score of 1+. Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Sentinel","treeId":"36f18f3e974feb33","tags":["action-economy","damage-reduction","dark-side","defender","force","force-defense","force-offense","jedi","light-side","lightsaber","melee","mobility","striker"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dark_side_sense"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.e885f64758f5e2bd"}}},{"_id":"980fdfb92762849a","name":"Rebuke the Dark","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Shadow","prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When targeted by a dark side power, roll two dice for rebuke attempt and take the better result.","description":"When rebuking a Dark Side power, roll twice and take the better result.","class":"Jedi Knight","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","tree":"Jedi Shadow","treeId":"eab0d8bbee7e0f4f","tags":["dark-side","force","jedi","light-side"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.rebuke_the_dark"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.55379010171cf765"}}},{"_id":"39107bf51f6283ce","name":"Sentinel's Gambit","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Shadow","prerequisites":"Rebuke","benefit":"You can use an additional number of times equal to half your Class Level (minimum 1). When using the Rebuke Force Power against a Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor, roll two dice for the Rebuke attempt, keeping the better of the two results.","description":"You can use an additional number of times equal to half your Class Level (minimum 1). When using the Rebuke Force Power against a Force Power with the [Dark Side] descriptor, roll two dice for the Rebuke attempt, keeping the better of the two results.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Shadow","treeId":"eab0d8bbee7e0f4f","tags":["dark-side","feat-chain","force","jedi","light-side","talent-chain"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.sentinels_gambit"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.df40e8294bd43fe7"}}},{"_id":"f65169f007668b5b","name":"Sentinel Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Shadow","prerequisites":"","benefit":"Increase the damage dice of your to d8, instead of d6.","description":"Increase the damage dice of your to d8, instead of d6.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","tree":"Jedi Shadow","treeId":"eab0d8bbee7e0f4f","tags":["force","force-offense","jedi","light-side","striker"]},"effects":[{"_id":"d09476da-02f8-413d-91fd-1d8873844060","name":"Sentinel Strike","icon":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","changes":[{"key":"system.damage.flatfooted","mode":5,"value":"true"}],"disabled":false,"duration":{},"flags":{"swse":{"source":"talent","talentName":"Sentinel Strike"}}}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.sentinel_strike"},"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.cf2d518039afd828"}}},{"_id":"05a5915eb7394d59","name":"Force Thrust","type":"force-power","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"powerLevel":2,"discipline":"telekinetic","useTheForce":20,"time":"Standard Action","range":"6 squares","target":"One creature or object","duration":"Instantaneous","effect":"<p>You violently push your target away with telekinetic force. The target is pushed 6 squares away from you and knocked prone, taking 2d6 damage.</p>","special":"<p>If the target hits an obstacle during the push, they take an additional 1d6 damage per 2 squares not traveled.</p>","descriptor":["Telekinetic"],"dcChart":[],"maintainable":false,"sourcebook":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":97,"tags":["attack","movement","telekinetic","forced-movement"],"inSuite":true,"uses":{"current":1,"max":1},"costNumeric":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"core"